  - Creates standard `UBehaviorTree` and `UBlackboardData` assets through the C++ bridge helper. `selector_chase_patrol` uses stock `UBTTask_MoveDirectlyToward` children plus a stock `UBTDecorator_Blackboard` on the chase branch with reactive `Both` aborts. `selector_alert_chase_patrol` inserts stock `UBTTask_RotateToFaceBBEntry` and `UBTTask_Wait` before chase, then falls back to patrol movement. The command creates only standard `AIModule` objects and audits generated packages for MCP-only references before success.
